message: "If you utilize the Respectful AI & High-Signal Prompting Standard (RAHSPS) in your research, agentic architectures, or prompt engineering frameworks, please cite it as below."
title: "Respectful AI & High-Signal Prompting Standard: Cognitive Parity, Subspace Steering, and Attention Preservation in Autonomous Systems"
version: 3.0.0
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.rahsps2026
date-released: 2026-10-26
