abstract: >-
  The Respectful AI & High-Signal Prompting Standard (RAHSPS) defines an engineering
  protocol and mathematical rationale for human-agent interaction. By establishing
  formal cognitive anchors (such as 'Respected Agent'), the protocol functions as a
  System 2 forcing function for human engineers while performing prefix-bias subspace
  steering within transformer embedding manifolds, reducing hallucination rates and
  preserving finite KV-cache attention capacity.
